@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Officer Reports

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Sourcing Officer / Reports
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Officer’s report workspace: the initial comparison report
(to the Evaluation Committee) and, after evaluation, the
full report submitted to the Sourcing Manager.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Officer

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/Reports

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Create/edit OfficerComparison and FullEvaluation
  TenderReports (new VersionNumber + PreviousReportId on
  resubmission).
- Submit the full report to the Sourcing Manager; notify.
- Show the Manager’s ReviewComment on returned versions.

DEPENDENCIES:
TenderReports, CommitteeRounds, Notifications, AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Required by the approved workflow but no Trello card covers
it — team assignment required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Officer Reports";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Reports";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Your comparison reports for the Evaluation Committee and the full reports you submit to the Sourcing Manager.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Officer report flow</h2>
    <ol class="pg-steps">
        <li><div><strong>Comparison report</strong><small>Prepared from the bid comparison and sent with the round to the Evaluation Committee</small></div></li>
        <li><div><strong>Evaluation result</strong><small>Returns to you after the committee’s 4/4 approval</small></div></li>
        <li><div><strong>Full report</strong><small>You submit it to the Sourcing Manager</small></div></li>
        <li><div><strong>Returned?</strong><small>A correction creates a new version; submitted versions are never overwritten</small></div></li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-reports">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-reports">Reports</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Tender</th><th scope="col">Report type</th><th scope="col">Version</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Created</th><th scope="col">Submitted</th><th scope="col">Reviewer decision</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="7"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No reports yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
